=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Comparator''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Mad Redstone Engineer}} for {{Coins|10}}.

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Comparators''' cannot be placed down, and therefore cannot be used.

